{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG44XY6CHTT8ACFTSVP5XWN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 櫻坂46としての初めての『1st TOUR 2021』\n 会場に足を運んでくださった皆さん、配信をご覧くださった皆さん、本当にありがとうございました。\n \n \n 皆さんが作り出してくださるペンライトがすごく綺麗で目がうるうるしてしまいました。\n ありがとうございました☺︎\n \n \n \n たくさんタオルやうちわを見つけられて嬉しかったなあ。\n ライブは皆さんからの愛をすごく感じることができます。\n その愛を倍にして返していきたいです。\n \n \n 素敵なお花もありがとうございました☺︎\n 全部見ましたよー🌸\n \n \n \n 写真載せます！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG44Z8CHDWVETG6RX7SDD61","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG4511GWXV9DZV8GS1T381A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n このちょこんと感かわいい。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG45234PPJ3B3XHT10HMNXT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG45354KJM8J4ZREQ3ZAP92","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG454EZDZQDZVD77CGGYWEV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG455JS5ZY47JTNJX5TTWWN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG456T0NGE0265WW97Y0ZKP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n いろんな髪型をしました。\n 前髪を分けるのはライブ初挑戦でした！\n みんなが褒めてくれて嬉しかったなあ。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG457V51WHW6JYFFJF3XXM2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ぴーす。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG458XTR14YV2CF2MD79VER","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n 